# Blossoming Defense: in response to Bot2's Lightning Bolt at Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2), the Defense makes it a 2/4 with
# hexproof until end of turn (CR 702.11b), so the Bolt has no legal target on resolution and is countered (CR 608.2b).
# "Target creature you control": Bot2's Ornithopter is refused beside Bot1's own as the positive control. On turn 3 both
# the +2/+2 and the hexproof are gone (CR 514.2).

